{"id":"iglesia","lemma":"iglesia","pos":"noun","rank":684,"glosses":["church"],"ipa":"/iˈɡlesja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"iglesias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-iglesia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esa es una iglesia.","en":"That's a church.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78094"},{"text":"Las iglesias están marcadas en el mapa con una cruz.","en":"Churches are designated on the map with crosses.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691637"},{"text":"Eso es una iglesia.","en":"That's a church.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534671"},{"text":"Se erigieron iglesias por toda la isla.","en":"Churches were erected all over the island."},{"text":"Voy a la iglesia.","en":"I'm going to church.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/163191"}]}